From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 12:24:18 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(contact): rebuild everything around the performance
 controller as a session desk

Keep the 16-pad controller untouched. Replace the FAQ accordion with a recall
console (mixer channel strips driving an LCD monitor, as an accessible tabs
pattern), add a signal path and a brief builder that composes a mailto, and add
a status strip with a live Jakarta clock. Cream glass hardware from the About
kit, one dark routing panel, reduced-motion and no-JS safe.
